{% doc %}
  Renders the search layer of the header (docs/ui-spec/predictive-search.md
  §1–§8, §11; SRS TE-8 AC1, AC4, AC9–AC14). The caller places it right after
  the header-search-link anchor: the anchor's nextElementSibling is
  <modal-dialog data-layer="search">, whose first child is the <dialog>.
  assets/modal-dialog.js (ADR 0007) opens it with showModal(), closes it on Esc
  or a backdrop click and returns focus to the anchor. Without JavaScript the
  dialog stays closed and the anchor goes to the search page. Inside the
  dialog the form is a plain GET to the search page, so search works if
  assets/predictive-search.js fails to load.

  The dialog is a .drawer (position, backdrop, shared open/close motion in
  assets/base.css); popup sets --drawer-from to a vertical offset so it slides
  down. CSS never sets display on the groups; every element below that has a
  display of its own is listed in the [hidden] guard of assets/base.css, so
  [hidden] always hides.

  Two styles, one markup (data-style on the dialog):
  - popup: top band. The first row is the dark 80px bar of the header: logo
    (from 80rem), search field, close button. The "Search" h2 is hidden.
  - drawer: .drawer from the inline end, 90% / 420 / 480. Visible "Search" h2
    and close button, then the field on a light background.

  Rows, top to bottom: bar (form) · tablist · body (tabpanel, the only part
  that scrolls) · footer (status + "View all"). Inside the body, in DOM order:
  min-chars hint, skeleton, 0 results notice, error alert, listbox, discover.

  The clear button is a reset button: it empties the field without
  JavaScript and CSS hides it while the placeholder shows (field empty).

  Option elements are the <a role="option"> themselves, never wrapped in a list
  item: an option that contains a link fails axe nested-interactive. Group
  titles are plain <div>: a heading inside a listbox fails axe
  aria-required-children. Tabs, discover, notices and the footer link sit
  outside the listbox (§8, §10).

  States without JavaScript logic (CSS only, assets/base.css):
  - Field empty (:placeholder-shown): discover shows even while [hidden],
    footer and tablist never show.
  - Listbox not [hidden]: the footer link shows even while [hidden].
  Everything else is a [hidden] toggle owned by BE.

  Hooks for assets/predictive-search.js (ES1-T130, TE-8-R2-BE1, TE-8-R2-BE3):
  - <predictive-search>: data-url, data-money-format, data-label-count (%n is
    the number), data-label-empty, data-label-all, data-label-products (%s is
    the search terms), data-label-shop-all + data-shop-all-url (footer link at
    0 results), data-label-loading, data-label-sale-price,
    data-label-regular-price.
  - Tablist data-testid="predictive-search-tabs" ([hidden] until results):
    buttons with data-predictive-tab = all, products, collections, articles,
    pages (queries has no tab: suggestions show in All only). Every tab but
    All is [hidden] until its group has results. aria-selected + roving
    tabindex on the buttons; the count goes in [data-predictive-count] ("8+"
    at the limit). The body is the tabpanel (id PredictiveSearchPanel): BE
    sets its aria-labelledby to the selected tab, and data-tab="<key>" on
    <predictive-search> (no attribute = all). CSS reads data-tab: products
    shows the product group as a card grid 2 / 4 / 5 columns; all shows
    4 cards from 80rem in the popup, rows below.
  - Link template: the icon slot holds a grid icon (collections) and a page
    icon (pages, articles without image); CSS shows the one for the group.
    data-predictive-image there is the 64 × 48 article image; remove it when
    there is no image (CSS hides it in the collections group).
  - data-predictive-group: queries, products, collections, articles, pages;
    hidden until filled. data-predictive-options: where cloned options go.
  - data-predictive-template: query, product, link. Inside the clones:
    data-predictive-image, data-predictive-title, data-predictive-price,
    data-predictive-meta (collection count, article date; remove when empty).
    query: put the typed part in <mark> inside data-predictive-title (shown
    400, the rest 600). product: data-predictive-price-label (swap to
    data-label-sale-price on sale), data-predictive-compare-group +
    data-predictive-compare (compare-at price), data-predictive-badge
    (-N%, .product-card__badge data-badge="sale"), data-predictive-sold-out;
    on the option set data-on-sale and data-unavailable (image 0.6).
  - data-predictive-hint (#PredictiveSearchHint): show at 1 character and set
    aria-describedby="PredictiveSearchHint" on the input; remove both at 0 or 2+.
  - data-predictive-spinner in the form: show while a request is pending (CSS
    then hides the clear button). data-predictive-skeleton: first load only.
  - data-predictive-empty (predictive-search-empty): 0 results; fill every
    [data-predictive-terms] with the terms (textContent).
  - data-predictive-error: wraps the predictive-search-error alert; the
    button has data-retry (predictive-search-error-button).
  - data-predictive-discover: recent, popular searches, popular collections,
    trending. Show it at 1 character and with 0 results; hide it otherwise.
    data-predictive-no-products: line above Trending when products are 0.
    Chips carry data-predictive-query: fill the field and run suggestions.
  - data-predictive-recent (predictive-search-recent, Should TE-8-R2-BE3):
    [hidden] until there are saved terms. data-predictive-recent-list gets
    clones of template[data-predictive-recent-item] (set href ?q= and
    data-predictive-query); data-predictive-recent-clear empties it.
  - Footer link predictive-search-all ([hidden]): set the text of
    data-predictive-all-label (keep the arrow), href and visibility.
  - Clear button: native reset; JS moves focus back to the input on the form
    reset event.
  - Test ids: predictive-search, predictive-search-dialog,
    predictive-search-close, predictive-search-form, predictive-search-input,
    predictive-search-submit, predictive-search-clear, predictive-search-tabs,
    predictive-search-tab, predictive-search-body, predictive-search-hint,
    predictive-search-skeleton, predictive-search-listbox,
    predictive-search-group, predictive-search-option,
    predictive-search-empty, predictive-search-error,
    predictive-search-discover, predictive-search-recent,
    predictive-search-popular, predictive-search-popular-collections,
    predictive-search-trending, predictive-search-all,
    predictive-search-status.

  @param {string} [style] - popup (default) or drawer, from the header Search style setting
  @param {image} [logo] - Logo shown in the popup bar from 80rem; the shop name when empty
  @param {number} [logo_width] - Logo width in px, same as the header
  @param {collection[]} [popular_collections] - Header setting Popular collections, up to 4; empty hides the list
  @param {collection} [trending_collection] - Header setting Trending products, first 4 products; empty hides the grid

  @example
  {% render 'predictive-search', style: block.settings.search_style, logo: logo, logo_width: block.settings.logo_width, popular_collections: block.settings.popular_collections, trending_collection: block.settings.trending_products %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign search_style = style | default: 'popup'
  if search_style != 'drawer'
    assign search_style = 'popup'
  endif

  assign terms_slot = '<span data-predictive-terms></span>'
  assign regular_price_label = 'products.price.regular_price' | t
  assign sold_out_label = 'products.card.sold_out' | t
  assign error_heading = 'blocks.predictive_search.error_title' | t
  assign error_text = 'blocks.predictive_search.error_body_html' | t: terms: terms_slot

  # Product image: row 64px; card in tab All from 80rem (popup) and in tab Products
  assign result_sizes = 'auto, 64px'
  if search_style == 'popup'
    assign result_sizes = 'auto, (min-width: 80rem) 250px, 64px'
  endif
-%}

<modal-dialog data-layer="search">
  <dialog
    class="predictive-search-dialog drawer{% if search_style == 'drawer' %} drawer--end drawer--wide{% endif %}"
    data-style="{{ search_style }}"
    scroll-lock
    aria-labelledby="PredictiveSearchTitle"
    data-testid="predictive-search-dialog"
  >
    <predictive-search
      class="predictive-search"
      data-testid="predictive-search"
      data-url="{{ routes.predictive_search_url }}"
      data-money-format="{{ shop.money_format | escape }}"
      data-label-count="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.count' | t: number: '%n' | escape }}"
      data-label-empty="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.empty' | t: terms: '%s' | escape }}"
      data-label-all="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.all' | t: terms: '%s' | escape }}"
      data-label-products="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.view_products' | t: terms: '%s' | escape }}"
      data-label-shop-all="{{ 'search.shop_all' | t | escape }}"
      data-shop-all-url="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
      data-label-loading="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.loading' | t | escape }}"
      data-label-sale-price="{{ 'products.price.sale_price' | t | escape }}"
      data-label-regular-price="{{ regular_price_label | escape }}"
    >
      <div class="predictive-search__bar">
        <h2
          class="predictive-search__title {% if search_style == 'drawer' %}drawer__title{% else %}visually-hidden{% endif %}"
          id="PredictiveSearchTitle"
        >
          {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.dialog_label' | t -}}
        </h2>

        {% if search_style == 'popup' %}
          <a
            class="site-header__logo predictive-search__logo"
            href="{{ routes.root_url }}"
            {% if logo %}
              aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
              style="--logo-width: {{ logo_width | default: 120 }}px;"
            {% endif %}
          >
            {%- if logo -%}
              {% assign logo_render_width = logo_width | default: 120 | times: 2 %}
              {% render 'image',
                image: logo,
                class: 'site-header__logo-image',
                width: logo_render_width,
                sizes: '240px',
                decorative: true
              %}
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="site-header__logo-text">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        <form
          class="predictive-search__form"
          action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          method="get"
          role="search"
          data-testid="predictive-search-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product,article,page">
          <input type="hidden" name="options[prefix]" value="last">

          <button
            class="site-header__icon predictive-search__submit"
            type="submit"
            aria-label="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.submit' | t | escape }}"
            data-testid="predictive-search-submit"
          >
            {% render 'header-icon', name: 'search' %}
          </button>
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="PredictiveSearchInput">
            {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.input_label' | t -}}
          </label>
          <input
            class="predictive-search__input"
            id="PredictiveSearchInput"
            type="search"
            name="q"
            value=""
            placeholder="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.placeholder' | t | escape }}"
            autofocus
            autocomplete="off"
            role="combobox"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="PredictiveSearchListbox"
            aria-autocomplete="list"
            data-testid="predictive-search-input"
          >
          <button
            class="site-header__icon predictive-search__clear"
            type="reset"
            data-testid="predictive-search-clear"
          >
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.clear' | t }}</span>
            {% render 'header-icon', name: 'close' %}
          </button>
          <span class="spinner predictive-search__spinner" hidden aria-hidden="true" data-predictive-spinner></span>
        </form>

        <form class="predictive-search__close-form" method="dialog">
          {% # aria-label, not hidden text: the dialog is closed (display: none) on load, so a name from hidden content is empty. %}
          <button
            class="close-button predictive-search__close"
            type="submit"
            aria-label="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.close' | t | escape }}"
            data-testid="predictive-search-close"
          >
            {% render 'header-icon', name: 'close' %}
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>

      {%- liquid
        assign tab_keys = 'all,products,collections,articles,pages' | split: ','
      -%}
      <div
        class="predictive-search__tabs featured-collection__tabs"
        role="tablist"
        aria-label="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.tabs_label' | t | escape }}"
        hidden
        data-testid="predictive-search-tabs"
      >
        {% for tab_key in tab_keys %}
          <button
            class="featured-collection__tab predictive-search__tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            id="PredictiveSearchTab-{{ tab_key }}"
            aria-controls="PredictiveSearchPanel"
            {% if forloop.first %}
              aria-selected="true"
              tabindex="0"
            {% else %}
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
              hidden
            {% endif %}
            data-predictive-tab="{{ tab_key }}"
            data-testid="predictive-search-tab"
          >
            {%- case tab_key -%}
              {%- when 'all' -%}
                {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.tab_all' | t -}}
              {%- when 'products' -%}
                {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_products' | t -}}
              {%- when 'collections' -%}
                {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_collections' | t -}}
              {%- when 'articles' -%}
                {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_articles' | t -}}
              {%- else -%}
                {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_pages' | t -}}
            {%- endcase -%}
            {%- unless forloop.first -%}
              <span class="predictive-search__tab-count" data-predictive-count></span>
            {%- endunless -%}
          </button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div
        class="drawer__body predictive-search__body"
        id="PredictiveSearchPanel"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="PredictiveSearchTab-all"
        data-testid="predictive-search-body"
      >
        <p
          class="predictive-search__hint"
          id="PredictiveSearchHint"
          hidden
          data-predictive-hint
          data-testid="predictive-search-hint"
        >
          <span class="predictive-search__hint-icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'info' %}</span>
          {{ 'blocks.predictive_search.min_chars' | t }}
        </p>

        <div
          class="predictive-search__skeleton"
          hidden
          aria-hidden="true"
          data-predictive-skeleton
          data-testid="predictive-search-skeleton"
        >
          <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-lines">
            <span class="skeleton skeleton--line"></span>
            <span class="skeleton skeleton--line skeleton--short"></span>
            <span class="skeleton skeleton--line"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="predictive-search__skeleton-items">
            {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
              <div class="skeleton-card predictive-search__skeleton-item">
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--media"></span>
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--line"></span>
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--line skeleton--short"></span>
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="predictive-search__notice"
          hidden
          data-predictive-empty
          data-testid="predictive-search-empty"
        >
          <span class="predictive-search__notice-icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'search' %}</span>
          <div class="predictive-search__notice-body">
            <h3 class="predictive-search__notice-title" data-testid="predictive-search-empty-heading">
              {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.no_results_title_html' | t: terms: terms_slot -}}
            </h3>
            <p class="predictive-search__notice-text">{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.no_results_hint' | t }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="predictive-search__error" hidden data-predictive-error>
          {% render 'empty-state',
            kind: 'error',
            heading: error_heading,
            text: error_text,
            heading_tag: 'h3',
            testid: 'predictive-search-error'
          %}
        </div>

        <div
          class="predictive-search__listbox"
          id="PredictiveSearchListbox"
          role="listbox"
          aria-label="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.listbox_label' | t | escape }}"
          hidden
          data-testid="predictive-search-listbox"
        >
          {%- liquid
            assign groups = 'queries,products,collections,articles,pages' | split: ','
          -%}
          {% for group in groups %}
            <div
              class="predictive-search__group predictive-search__group--{{ group }}"
              role="group"
              aria-labelledby="PredictiveSearchGroup-{{ group }}"
              hidden
              data-predictive-group="{{ group }}"
              data-testid="predictive-search-group"
            >
              <div class="predictive-search__group-title" id="PredictiveSearchGroup-{{ group }}">
                {%- case group -%}
                  {%- when 'queries' -%}
                    {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_queries' | t -}}
                  {%- when 'products' -%}
                    {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_products' | t -}}
                  {%- when 'collections' -%}
                    {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_collections' | t -}}
                  {%- when 'articles' -%}
                    {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_articles' | t -}}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.group_pages' | t -}}
                {%- endcase -%}
              </div>
              <div class="predictive-search__options" data-predictive-options></div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <div
          class="predictive-search__discover"
          hidden
          data-predictive-discover
          data-testid="predictive-search-discover"
        >
          <p class="predictive-search__no-products" hidden data-predictive-no-products>
            {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.no_products_html' | t: terms: terms_slot -}}
          </p>

          <div class="predictive-search__discover-side">
            <div
              class="predictive-search__discover-group"
              hidden
              data-predictive-recent
              data-testid="predictive-search-recent"
            >
              <div class="predictive-search__discover-head">
                <h3 class="popular-searches__title">{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.recent' | t }}</h3>
                <button
                  class="predictive-search__text-button"
                  type="button"
                  aria-label="{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.clear_recent_label' | t | escape }}"
                  data-predictive-recent-clear
                >
                  {{- 'blocks.predictive_search.clear_recent' | t -}}
                </button>
              </div>
              <ul class="search-chips" role="list" data-predictive-recent-list></ul>
              <template data-predictive-recent-item>
                <li><a class="search-chip" href="{{ routes.search_url }}" data-predictive-query></a></li>
              </template>
            </div>

            {% render 'popular-searches',
              heading_tag: 'h3',
              testid: 'predictive-search-popular',
              class: 'predictive-search__discover-group'
            %}

            {%- if popular_collections != blank -%}
              <div
                class="predictive-search__discover-group"
                data-testid="predictive-search-popular-collections"
              >
                <h3 class="popular-searches__title">{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.popular_collections' | t }}</h3>
                <ul class="predictive-search__links" role="list">
                  {%- for popular_collection in popular_collections limit: 4 -%}
                    <li>
                      <a class="predictive-search__link" href="{{ popular_collection.url }}">
                        <span class="predictive-search__icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'grid' %}</span>
                        <span class="predictive-search__link-title">{{ popular_collection.title | escape }}</span>
                        <span class="predictive-search__meta">
                          {{- 'collections.products_count' | t: count: popular_collection.products_count -}}
                        </span>
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          {%- if trending_collection != blank and trending_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
            <div
              class="predictive-search__discover-group predictive-search__trending"
              data-testid="predictive-search-trending"
            >
              <h3 class="popular-searches__title">{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.trending' | t }}</h3>
              <ul class="predictive-search__trending-grid" role="list">
                {%- for trending_product in trending_collection.products limit: 4 -%}
                  <li>
                    {% render 'product-card',
                      product: trending_product,
                      sizes: '(min-width: 80rem) 250px, 50vw',
                      heading_level: 'h4',
                      card_context: 'search',
                      show_swatches: false
                    %}
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="predictive-search__footer">
        <div class="predictive-search__status" role="status" data-testid="predictive-search-status"></div>
        <a
          class="button predictive-search__all"
          href="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          hidden
          data-testid="predictive-search-all"
        >
          <span data-predictive-all-label>{{ 'blocks.predictive_search.view_all' | t }}</span>
          {% render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
        </a>
      </div>

      <template data-predictive-template="query">
        <a
          class="predictive-search__option predictive-search__option--query"
          href="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          role="option"
          tabindex="-1"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-testid="predictive-search-option"
        >
          <span class="predictive-search__icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'search' %}</span>
          <span class="predictive-search__option-text">
            <span class="predictive-search__query" data-predictive-title></span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </template>

      <template data-predictive-template="product">
        <a
          class="predictive-search__option predictive-search__option--product"
          href="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          role="option"
          tabindex="-1"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-testid="predictive-search-option"
        >
          <span class="predictive-search__media">
            <img
              class="predictive-search__image"
              alt=""
              width="64"
              height="64"
              sizes="{{ result_sizes }}"
              loading="lazy"
              data-predictive-image
            >
            <span class="product-card__badge predictive-search__badge" data-badge="sale" hidden data-predictive-badge></span>
          </span>
          <span class="predictive-search__option-text">
            <span class="predictive-search__product-title" data-predictive-title></span>
            <span class="predictive-search__prices">
              <span class="visually-hidden" data-predictive-price-label>{{ regular_price_label }}</span>
              <span class="predictive-search__price" data-predictive-price></span>
              <span class="predictive-search__compare-group" hidden data-predictive-compare-group>
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{ regular_price_label }}</span>
                <s class="predictive-search__compare" data-predictive-compare></s>
              </span>
              <span class="predictive-search__sold-out" hidden data-predictive-sold-out>{{ sold_out_label }}</span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </template>

      <template data-predictive-template="link">
        <a
          class="predictive-search__option"
          href="{{ routes.search_url }}"
          role="option"
          tabindex="-1"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-testid="predictive-search-option"
        >
          <span class="predictive-search__icon">
            {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'grid' -%}
            {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'article' -%}
          </span>
          <img
            class="predictive-search__thumb"
            alt=""
            width="64"
            height="48"
            sizes="64px"
            loading="lazy"
            data-predictive-image
          >
          <span class="predictive-search__option-text">
            <span data-predictive-title></span>
            <span class="predictive-search__meta" data-predictive-meta></span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </template>
    </predictive-search>
  </dialog>
</modal-dialog>
